WEBVTT

00:16:29.385 --> 00:16:34.315
find something you want to do
from your heart and focus on that.

00:16:34.315 --> 00:16:38.535
That's what will allow you to work hard
and do great things in life.

00:16:38.535 --> 00:16:40.755
So I would encourage everyone
to challenge,

00:16:40.755 --> 00:16:44.135
to find something 
from your heart to do that.

00:16:45.135 --> 00:16:48.575
And above all, technology 
is truly transformative.

00:16:48.575 --> 00:16:50.815
I'm a technology optimist.

00:16:51.275 --> 00:16:55.135
I think technology will make 
a big difference for India.

00:16:55.135 --> 00:16:56.725
And more importantly, I think

00:16:56.725 --> 00:17:01.325
India will make a big difference
for technology at a global scale.